---
/**
 * Dark docs, always (site redesign spec §1.5, #454). Starlight's provider follows the OS, which
 * rendered the docs light on a light OS while the site is dark-only. Inlined so the theme is set
 * before first paint.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
</script>
